"Eldrin Wellsprings": {
  "index": -99,
  "category": "eldrin_altar",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Eldrin Wellsprings"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "There is a network of points of power scattered through the world. These points are called "
        },
        {
          "text": "Eldrin Wellsprings",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ". Wellsprings are commonly associated with one of the affinities, and vary in power as well. \n\nThere is a rare form of wellspring that is "
        },
        {
          "text": "typeless, ",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": "as indicated by its white beam and its blue swirls.  These rare wellsprings will "
        },
        {
          "text": "permanently convert to the structure lens type used when captured for the first time",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nWellsprings are invisible unless captured or unless the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Wellspring Sight Unguent",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " (or the more powerful "
        },
        {
          "text": "Eldrin Sight Unguent",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " made by the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Council of Wizards",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ") is active.  I don't need to be able to see a wellspring to capture it, if I know where it is. \n\nThose aligned with the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Council of Wizards",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " can use the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Eldrin Flight",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " spell to travel quickly to nearby wellsprings, and the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Eldrin Bracelet",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " to draw power from these wellsprings when in close proximity to reduce the mana cost of their spells.  All factions can make use of Eldrin Power for crafting purposes equally, however."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
